.*
# The blanket .* rule above hides every dotfile/dir. Re-include the ones a public
# repo must ship: git metadata, CI workflows, and the env template.
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/**
!.env.example
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
*.log
tools
automate.py
*.sh
*.bat
.env
!.env.example
.venv
__env__/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
.env.bak/
*.db
media/
staticfiles/
output/
.vscode/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
**/migrations/
**/migrations/*.pyc
**/migrations/__pycache__/
**/migrations/*.py
!**/migrations/__init__.py
